{"uid":"34da24b9ca8bb751","name":"test_import_skill_non_base_version","fullName":"tests.ui.skills.test_skill_export_import.TestSkillExportImportNonBaseVersion#test_import_skill_non_base_version","historyId":"3928f5d1c03fdf8e2f1686f550ee2c61","time":{"start":1785996169273,"stop":1785996208757,"duration":39484},"description":"Export a skill's ver_1 version, import the file, verify the round trip.\n\n        Steps (see AFS for full detail):\n        1. Create a Skill with base version; note the source skill ID.\n        2. Edit instructions, click \"Save As Version\" → create `ver_1`.\n        3. With `ver_1` selected, export via the overflow menu; verify\n           the downloaded filename embeds the version name.\n        4. Read the exported file; verify frontmatter (incl. `elitea_version`)\n           and instructions body.\n        5. Navigate to Skills list; import the exported file; verify the\n           Import parameters dialog previews the ver_1 content.\n        6. Confirm import; verify navigation + unique new skill ID.\n        7. Verify imported skill's version is `base` and fields match the\n           exported ver_1 content.\n        8. Edit + save the imported skill; verify a clean save.\n        ","descriptionHtml":"<p>Export a skill's ver_1 version, import the file, verify the round trip.</p>\n<pre><code>    Steps (see AFS for full detail):\n    1. Create a Skill with base version; note the source skill ID.\n    2. Edit instructions, click &quot;Save As Version&quot; → create `ver_1`.\n    3. With `ver_1` selected, export via the overflow menu; verify\n       the downloaded filename embeds the version name.\n    4. Read the exported file; verify frontmatter (incl. `elitea_version`)\n       and instructions body.\n    5. Navigate to Skills list; import the exported file; verify the\n       Import parameters dialog previews the ver_1 content.\n    6. Confirm import; verify navigation + unique new skill ID.\n    7. Verify imported skill's version is `base` and fields match the\n       exported ver_1 content.\n    8. Edit + save the imported skill; verify a clean save.\n</code></pre>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"base_url","time":{"start":1785995475962,"stop":1785995475962,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_verify_url","time":{"start":1785995475962,"stop":1785995475962,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"pytestconfig","time":{"start":1785995475963,"stop":1785995475963,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"browser","time":{"start":1785995475963,"stop":1785995476489,"duration":526},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"delete_output_dir","time":{"start":1785995475963,"stop":1785995475963,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"auth_state","time":{"start":1785995476489,"stop":1785995478050,"duration":1561},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_browser_cookies","time":{"start":1785995478050,"stop":1785995483044,"duration":4994},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplay